"Flying Bird" by sandeep.s
- Source:  https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/flying-bird-eb843194e06d429ebef7dd4aa7e265c1
- Author:  sandeep.s (https://sketchfab.com/sandeep.s)
- License: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC-BY 4.0)
           https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
- Files:
    public/sketchfab/flying_bird.glb     (verbatim copy of the original)
    public/flying_bird_static.glb        (modified: 3 meshes joined into one,
                                          materials/UVs stripped)
    public/flying_bird_vat.bin           (modified: per-frame vertex positions
                                          baked into a Vertex Animation Texture)
- Modifications are performed by tools/bake_flying_bird.py.
- Attribution to sandeep.s is displayed in the running application's HUD.
